<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post116252823105529970..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: What The Regime Does to &quot;Great Americans&quot;</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>7</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2826551205843189477</id><published>2010-09-20T16:25:43.747-06:00</published><updated>2010-09-20T16:25:43.747-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anon -- someone sufficiently despondent, sufficien...</title><content type='html'>Anon -- someone sufficiently despondent, sufficiently upset with himself, would commit suicide for exactly that reason.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/2826551205843189477'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/2826551205843189477'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html?showComment=1285021543747#c2826551205843189477' title=''/><author><name>Jim O&#39;Connor</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116252823105529970' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116252823105529970' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-496434540"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 20, 2010 at 4:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3751103471571845692</id><published>2007-06-05T21:52:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-06-05T21:52:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>If Westhusing was a devout Catholic, he would not ...</title><content type='html'>If Westhusing was a devout Catholic, he would not have killed himself. That would mean he would burn eternally in Hell. That is what the Catholic church teaches.  I imagine he was &#39;suicided&#39; , like so many other whistleblowers.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/3751103471571845692'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/3751103471571845692'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html?showComment=1181101920000#c3751103471571845692' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116252823105529970' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116252823105529970' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 5, 2007 at 9:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116275849974951856</id><published>2006-11-05T13:28:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2006-11-05T13:28:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>zchris63, the link is all there. Just move the mou...</title><content type='html'>zchris63, the link is all there. Just move the mouse far to the right past the margin and it picks up the link just fine. Or just go here: &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://video.google.com/videoplay?docid=-6621486727392146155&amp;q=iraq+for+sale&amp;hl=en&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Iraq for Sale&lt;/A&gt;.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;We&#39;re aware of Blackwater in this area since they&#39;re located in nearby Moyock, NC. In fact, the news person who spoke of the &quot;locals killed&quot; near the beginning of the video is David Nelson (WAVY-TV) out of Portsmouth, VA.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Blackwater is just one of thousands of private contractors who feed and are fattened SOLELY from leviathan&#39;s teat.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116275849974951856'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116275849974951856'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html?showComment=1162758480000#c116275849974951856' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116252823105529970' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116252823105529970' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 5, 2006 at 1:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116273165741537864</id><published>2006-11-05T06:00:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2006-11-05T06:00:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The link got truncated in my earlier post. Search ...</title><content type='html'>The link got truncated in my earlier post. Search for &quot;iraq for sale&quot; by Robert Greenwald at google video, there are several trailers listed in addition to the full length (1hr 15min) video.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116273165741537864'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116273165741537864'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html?showComment=1162731600000#c116273165741537864' title=''/><author><name>zchris63</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15044325194992357871</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116252823105529970' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116252823105529970' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-60614549"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 5, 2006 at 6:00 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116273146072412341</id><published>2006-11-05T05:57:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2006-11-05T05:57:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The documentary &quot;Iraq for Sale&quot; goes into great de...</title><content type='html'>The documentary &quot;Iraq for Sale&quot; goes into great detail about how the interrogations at Abu Ghraib were conducted by both the military and civilian contractors, and makes a point to highlight the fact that while the military personnel were somewhat held accountable for their actions, the civilian personnel got off scott free. Google video has it in its entirety, http://video.google.com/videoplay?docid=-6621486727392146155&amp;q=iraq+for+sale&amp;hl=en</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116273146072412341'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116273146072412341'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html?showComment=1162731420000#c116273146072412341' title=''/><author><name>zchris63</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15044325194992357871</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116252823105529970' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116252823105529970' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-60614549"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 5, 2006 at 5:57 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116266498720889332</id><published>2006-11-04T11:29:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2006-11-04T11:29:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>As someone who heard more than enough of the demen...</title><content type='html'>As someone who heard more than enough of the dementia that is the Sean Hannity show I think I know why they do this. It comes from watching too many WW II movies where the Nazis are always saying &quot;Heil Hitler&quot; to each other over the phone.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116266498720889332'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116266498720889332'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html?showComment=1162664940000#c116266498720889332' title=''/><author><name>Flavius Aetius</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12523103626633461512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116252823105529970' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116252823105529970' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-322203959"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 4, 2006 at 11:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116259115492262745</id><published>2006-11-03T14:59:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2006-11-03T14:59:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It all starts to remind you of Orwell&#39;s 1984, does...</title><content type='html'>It all starts to remind you of Orwell&#39;s 1984, doesn&#39;t it?  Good is bad, bad is good.  It&#39;s hard to keep your bearings unless you have some moral standard apart from the state and the media (and, sad to say, the church in too many cases).</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116259115492262745'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116252823105529970/comments/default/116259115492262745'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html?showComment=1162591140000#c116259115492262745' title=''/><author><name>JT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12511087200420823532</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/11/what-regime-does-to-great-americans.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116252823105529970' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116252823105529970' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1192680342"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 3, 2006 at 2:59 PM"/></entry></feed>